    text-align: left;
  }
}
</style>
	</div>
	
<p>Steam is an effective cleaning method for a number of reasons. Not only does steam kill germs, but it also helps clean various surfaces without any harsh scrubbing or rubbing. By using steam, we also use as little water as possible, and you enjoy all the amazing benefits!</p>
