    text-align: left;
  }
}
</style>
	</div>
	
<p>Our packages are designed to cater for a variety of needs. While some basic packages include a thorough exterior clean, others are specific for the interior of your vehicle. There are also more extensive packages that include both the interior, exterior, and various extras. With packages starting at $160 for <strong>interior car detailing, </strong>optional extras can also be requested according to your specific needs. For example, if you need to get rid of pet hair, this treatment can be added on. With Wash Me Now, your needs and complete satisfaction is our number one priority!</p>
<a href="/prices/" class="button primary is-large lowercase"  style="border-radius:99px;">
